# Private research notes. NEVER commit these.
#
# /knowledge/ holds honest strategic vulnerabilities and the weakest rebuttals —
# material that must not be readable by anyone else in the committee. The site is
# served publicly by GitHub Pages from this repo, and the github.io origin is not
# behind Cloudflare Access, so anything committed here is world-readable.
#
# These files previously sat at asmun/knowledge/, inside the published directory.
# They were never committed. They now live at the repo root, outside /asmun/, and
# are ignored here so they cannot be added back by accident.
/knowledge/

# Browser-verification artifacts, written to the repo root by the Playwright run
# that checks the rendered site. Evidence, not source — regenerate them, don't commit them.
/.playwright-mcp/
